/**
 * @mainpage Lintra
 *
 * **Lintra** is a C project template with a built-in, CI/CD-friendly toolkit
 * that automates linting (MISRA C:2012 via cppcheck), testing (Ceedling) and
 * building (make) with minimal setup.
 *
 * This is the API reference of the example modules shipped with the template.
 *
 * @section main_layers Layers and modules
 *
 * - @ref hal  - hardware abstraction layer
 *   - @ref hal_gpio
 * - @ref util - general purpose utilities
 *   - @ref util_calc
 *   - @ref util_mul
 * - @ref led  - LED driver built on top of @ref hal_gpio
 *
 * @section main_guides Guides
 *
 * - @subpage architecture
 * - @subpage workflow
 *
 * @section main_example Quick example
 *
 * @code
 * #include "led/led.h"
 *
 * int main(void)
 * {
 *     led_init();
 *     led_on();
 *
 *     return 0;
 * }
 * @endcode
 */
